      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STIPULATED (6) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a 2 length second (28.31) behind Devil's Sympathy at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. KRIS BAR IMOGEN (2) was below best last time but the start prior was a Rank Limit - Grade 5 winner in the quickest time on the card at Shepparton over 450m in a Rank Limit - Grade 5. Well placed here and should do much better. MONTANA ICON (1) was a winner (25.51) at Shepparton two back but out of the placings last time when 8th at this track. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Bold showing expected. WHIRLER (7) is worth some thought after placing last start.",
